# Playwright POM Automation Framework

Playwright automation framework using JavaScript and Page Object Model (POM)
for testing Sauce Demo.

## Tech Stack

- Playwright
- JavaScript
- Node.js
- GitHub Actions

## Coverage

### UI Testing
- Login
- Product validation
- Product sorting
- Cart
- Checkout
- Checkout validation
- Order completion

### API Testing
- ...

## Project Structure

pages/
test-data/
tests/
.github/workflows/
playwright.config.js

## Installation

npm install
npx playwright install

## Run Tests

npx playwright test

## Run Headed

npx playwright test --headed

## View Report

npx playwright show-report